<speak>I'm ready with the next lines. Please use Japanese yen as the currency for this transaction. The amount I am committing to this transaction is <sub alias="ten em">10m</sub>. The quantity I want to transact is 700 units. Please place this as a market order. That's the section I had prepared. I'll put my pen down for a moment, because I tend to start doodling when I'm concentrating and then wonder whether the doodle is a note. My wife has left the tea beside me, so everything is quite settled here. We can carry on without me disappearing to the kitchen.</speak>